---
title: "Téotime Pacreau"
description: "Gestion de projet numérique et développement web à Nantes"
pageId: "Homepage"
layout: "base.njk"
type: "Page"
---

<div id="homepage-profil" class="intersect">
  <img
    aria-hidden="true"
    loading="eager"
    src="/img/profil_mobile_59.webp"
    height="59"
    width="59"
    srcset="/img/profil_mobile_59.webp 59w, /img/profil_112.webp 112w"
    sizes="(max-width: 600px) 59px, 112px"
  />
  <h1>Téotime Pacreau</h1>
</div>
<section id="homepage-brief" class="intersect">
  <h2>Conduite de projets numériques et mains dans le code</h2>
  <article>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span><span style="font-feature-settings: 'ss06' 1; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 32;">->&nbsp&nbsp</span>AMOA</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span><span style="font-feature-settings: 'ss06' 1; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 32;">->&nbsp&nbsp</span>Mode produit</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span><span style="font-feature-settings: 'ss06' 1; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 32;">->&nbsp&nbsp</span>Développement web</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</section>
<section id="homepage-blog-shortlist" class="intersect">
  <header class="homepage-projets-titre-flexer">
    <h2>Derniers articles du blog</h2>
  </header>
  <ul style="margin-top: calc(.5*var(--rythme))">
    {%- for post in collections.articlesShortlist -%}
      <li style="list-style-type: none; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 22;">
        <span style="font-feature-settings: 'ss06' 1; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 32;">{{ loop.index }}&nbsp&nbsp</span>
        <a href="{{post.url}}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</section>
<section class="intersect">
  <header class="homepage-projets-titre-flexer">
    <h2>Essais</h2>
  </header>
  <ul style="margin-top: calc(.5*var(--rythme))">{%- for post in collections.essais -%}
    <li style="list-style-type: none; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 22"><a href="{{post.url}}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></li>
  {%- endfor -%}</ul>
</section>

